                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_mjnkHk": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Hi, I'm Elaign, owner and curator behind Bag Reluxe. My passion for luxury bags and my love for selling came together in the perfect way, leading me to create this business. It all started with a simple love for handbags and a keen eye for finding great deals. What began as a small collection of preloved bags that I cleaned and brought back to life, has grown into a carefully curated store where I can share my passion with others.</p><p>I'm not just selling bags – I'm sharing stories, style, and sustainability. I get a thrill from finding beautiful, high-quality bags at unbeatable prices, then passing those savings on to my customers. Every bag I offer has been carefully authenticated and restored to its full potential, giving it new life and ensuring that you can enjoy luxury at an affordable price.</p><p>For me, it's not just about business – it's about sharing my love for bags and helping others find pieces they'll cherish for years. I believe every bag has a story, and I'm here to help you start yours with a piece that fits your style and budget.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": true,
                    "background_color": "#1e1e20",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
